    "is_used": "No",
    "explanation": "The text identifies a lack of 'consistent messaging' as a challenge, but it does not explicitly frame leaders or institutions as 'Corrupt' (engaging in illegal/unethical activities for gain) or 'Incompetent' (causing harm through ignorance/lack of skill). It suggests a need for better strategy/communication rather than inherent moral or functional failure of the actors themselves."
